{#
  The homepage audit form, on a page of its own.

  A ROUTE RATHER THAN A SINGLE, and only for now. Everything else on this site is an
  element with its own address, so the copy around it can be written in the control panel
  rather than in a template. This is here so the form can be seen and submitted while the
  page it eventually lives on is still being decided — the words below are placeholders
  and are meant to be replaced by fields on a single, not edited here.

  See craft/config/routes.php for the pattern that reaches it.
#}
{% extends '_layouts/page.twig' %}

{# Every view here sets this; _includes/page/head.twig reads it to work out which page
   it is rendering. #}
{% set tplPath = _self %}

{% block siteContent %}
    <div class="b-container">
        <h1>What does your homepage spend its space on?</h1>
        <p>We photograph the whole page — not just the first screen — cut it where your own
            markup changes, and measure what share of it goes to each of eight things.
            You get the number and the annotated screenshot it came from.</p>

        {% include '_components/audit-form.twig' %}
    </div>
{% endblock %}
